Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.50,0:02:12.23,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,Chiar dacă nu se potrivesc cu idealurile tale
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.28,0:02:14.01,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,Urmează-ți ambițiile în stilul tău
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.13,0:02:15.71,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,Chiar dacă nu se potrivesc cu idealurile tale
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.88,0:02:17.62,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,Urmează-ți ambițiile în stilul tău
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.40,0:02:32.10,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,Recklessly chasing who I want to become
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.60,0:02:37.83,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,But before I knew it, I had become an adult
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,Everyone believes that if they work hard, their dreams will come true
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,But it's not such a sweet story
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,Even if you desperrayely aim high
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,Results are everything, I know that, but I don't understand it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,Someday someone will see and believes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,And I'll keep walking today too
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,The scenery visile
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,When on the verge of giving up or breaking down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,Beyond the darkness
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,Of pain and despair
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,What awaits beyond the endless road
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,Even if it's far away, I will grab it with my hands
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,The shape of a dream different from the ideal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,Continuing to pursue and struggle
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,Just moving forward
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,In our own hands now
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,We change the game from our own side
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,Living freely in a world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,We have yet to see
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,Chiar dacă nu se potrivesc cu idealurile tale
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,Chase ambitions in your own way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,Chiar dacă nu se potrivesc cu idealurile tale
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,IMMORTAL TL,,0,0,0,,Chase ambitions in your own way
